* ⟪GTI18N_e577f9e9_000001⟫ are like references to arrays

A ⟪GTI18N_e577f9e9_000002⟫ does not store any data,
it just describes a section of an underlying array.

Changing the elements of a ⟪GTI18N_e577f9e9_000003⟫ modifies the
corresponding elements of its underlying array.

Other ⟪GTI18N_e577f9e9_000004⟫ that share the same underlying array will see those changes.

